# Unity .meta files ARE committed on purpose - do not add *.meta here.
#
# They carry the GUIDs that link scripts to scenes and prefabs. Without them every
# install regenerates GUIDs, so updating the package turns every ARPManager component
# in a user's project into "Missing (Mono Script)". libarpnative.so.meta also holds
# the Android/ARM64 import settings, without which Unity is left to infer them.

# Native build output (the source and build scripts ARE committed)
NativeSource/build/

# Packed release tarballs from npm pack - attach to the GitHub release, do not commit
*.tgz
*.tgz.meta

# Checksum output, written per-build in a consuming project
ARP/
last-build-checksums.json
last-build-checksums.txt

